<h2>Project Overview</h2>

<p>

This project explains how businesses use social media platforms such as Facebook, Instagram, LinkedIn, X (Twitter), and YouTube to promote Corporate Social Responsibility (CSR) initiatives. It demonstrates how digital communication helps organizations build trust, improve brand image, and engage communities through ethical and sustainable practices.

</p>

</div>

<div class="about-box">

<h2>Why This Topic?</h2>

<p>

CSR has become an important part of modern business strategy. Social media allows organizations to share their CSR activities with a wider audience, increasing transparency, customer engagement, and public awareness.

</p>

</div>

